	.string "What? Are you a MAGMA grunt?\p"
	.string "I joined to stop the factories. Now\n"
	.string "we're stealing a submarine.\p"
	.string "Why does a beach cleanup need a\n"
	.string "submarine? Nobody will tell me.$"

